### RAG query: game knowledge Q&A
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rag/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "这个boss第二阶段怎么打？",
  "gameId": "demo_game",
  "topK": 6,
  "debug": true
}

### RAG query with filters
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rag/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "1.2版本这个装备怎么获得？",
  "gameId": "demo_game",
  "topK": 6,
  "debug": true,
  "filters": {
    "doc_type": "guide",
    "version": "1.2"
  }
}

### Clear local RAG cache
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rag/cache/clear
